{"version":1,"content":"<p>圍繞英偉達前行政總裁黃仁勳近期所引發的爭議事件，再度出現新的調查進展。根據最新報道，一份調查報告聲稱，被指與黃仁勳關係密切的中國商界人士Alice Huang不僅曾與此前備受關注的企業存在關聯，還被發現與另一家能夠獲得受美國出口管制英偉達先進AI晶片的企業存在深層聯繫。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586312.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:45:31.610745+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T17:22:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_hash":"f75af3acb59e33c8216739cbcd217aacfdd205dc5a2e6639194fe54a84c2292c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}